// Clue Name :
"P157122556" "Notes on the ritual"
// DetailString :
"P2214765646" "These notes <br><br>'The first group is reporting results. Now that we know what to look for, it did not take long to verify it. So obvious, why didn't we see it before? It explains so much. <br>The second group has begun. They're trying to trace it out now. It's immense power, spreading out everywhere. Does Dr. Aeon even know? He must suspect! It would explain the clockwork, too. The ones out here, they're not under the control of the Clockwork King of Paragon City. They're under it's control. Incredible. <br><br>First group is back in. They've traced it's origin back. We will need Hardi's journals. We must get them, and soon. <br>The second group had to stop. They've been discovered. The Circle is watching. They're planning something. Something only their twisted minds could comprehend. I worry even more about Tarikoss. I warned that he would go to far and should have been stopped earlier. It may be too late know. I only hope I can get what we've discovered to my superiors.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P103975262" "So now you have come to me, to Tarikoss. You have heard that I am working on a strange scheme, and that I needed assistance to complete it? Of course. And it is certain that you heard from the charlatans who dwell on these isles and dare to call themselves mystics that my mysterious plans could lead to something of unimaginable power. Yes, this too is known to me. Perhaps you came as a spy for them? Perhaps you came seeking power, seeking strength to force your will onto the world? Such will, such desire, coupled with power and a wicked soul, that is what I need. So are you wicked? Are you powerful? Say what you will. Every petty fool with a taste for power on these islands say they are powerful and vile, but words are empty. Actions are needed.<A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you are to be part of this work, if you are to profit by my plans, then your wickedness must be matched only by your might. I can give you the chance to prove yourself to me.</A> Take it if you dare, or begon and return when are ready."
// AcceptString :
"P1850301412" "Prove yourself to Tarikoss"
// SendOffString :
"P2015622541" "Very well. You wish to prove you are capable? You wish to prove that you are without compunction? Good. Not far from here there is an office wherin a group who could cause this enterprise trouble have gathered. They are members of the pathetic Legacy Chain, and even now they cast spells of augury to ascertain my ends. You are to enter this place, take what they have uncovered so that no others will know it, and crush any survivors. Leave none standing. Then, we will begin."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3133089813" "Defeat all Legacy in office"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1253731021" "You will prove nothing by talking to me. Defeat all of the Legacy members in that office and bring me back what they learned."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3900271187" "According to the sign on the door, this office is supposed to be closed. That would make you the cleaning crew."

