// Dialog :
"P2891595122" "I felt their rituals break from here. You were merciless and efficient. Just what I've been looking for. I know now what you are, and you are exactly what I seek for this grim work. If you help me in this, then all the riches and wealth of the world shall be yours. If you have no stomach for darkness, if you're a mere poseur to villainy, then I have misjudged you and you may leave. But if you are willing to risk all the lives in the Isles and the world for your own power, then speak to me, for we will be ready to begin."
// RandomFameString :
"P3027400425" "I heard that {VillainName} is working with Virgil Tarikoss! That can't be good!"
